body:
You can use `_snippetResult` instead after setting up that on your index. https://www.algolia.com/doc/guides/searching/highlighting-snippeting/#snippeting-overview

Basically make sure that attribute is in `attributesToSnippet`

```js
search.addWidget(
  instantsearch.widgets.configure({
    attributesToSnippet: ['description:5'], // 5 words, still highlighted
  })
);
```
